          <p>The program does not push you toward a dramatic leap. We look honestly at what needs protection, what fear may be exaggerating, and how a transition can be tested through grounded first steps.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="chapter-faq">
          <summary>Is this career advice or job-search support?</summary>
